after_close
  daily_report
    schedule: Asia/Kolkata daily at 16:00, by calendar trading_days
    needs fetch_prices for the input this run needs, or wait
    expect success every 1d2h
    supports dry run
market_hours
  build_candles
    after fetch_prices
    if its input changed
    queue heavy
    timeout 30m
    fresh process
    max memory 512 MiB
  export_csv (command)
    after build_candles
  fetch_prices
    schedule: Asia/Kolkata every 30m from 09:15 to 15:30 on Mon, Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri, by calendar trading_days
    attempts 3, backoff 10s..=2m
    keep at most 50 runs
upkeep
  housekeeping
    schedule: Asia/Kolkata daily at 02:00
    one at a time
